{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手衛蘭（Janice）於紅館舉行一連四場的《衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會》香港站，今日（18日）來到尾場的演出，氣氛更為熱烈，未夠8時已經有過半觀眾入場。</p><p>尾場吸引到不少藝人到場支持，JW更是自婚訊公開後首次一同出席演唱會。到場支持的藝人分別有：JW與老公王至尊、楊千嬅與老公丁子高、關心妍、陳明憲、林盛斌、Nancy Kwai、胡子彤、方智弘等人。</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827515829915648143025.jpeg/x88fgmbBQsFTcMnCb2GNIRTJmjU8D2mCsjsa8IQ7GvA\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827513061543936736048.jpeg/tJN13Ib2mq8cv6n0DCv1NQyQcACMrR9Gamr9Blxq_QY\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊千嬅與老公丁子高。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827506925015040268974.jpeg/XK3-I-Fx5Wzi3Sj1iKR20pQUQywTYAPvcsqhlUTKoZU\"/><figcaption>楊千嬅與老公丁子高。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Nancy Kwai。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827503980482560351907.jpeg/3B8nAA96soivs7LmtVNmZ3SCceZg_P_FtP_1r4L_9a8\"/><figcaption>Nancy Kwai。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阿Bob。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827515095912448501749.jpeg/jPpj1aOiEI_1cys243REr2FwyAeTE5UPeuUxAEzlMQA\"/><figcaption>阿Bob。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胡子彤。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827512440786944781560.jpeg/15nMk0szJj0_oAcaVzS__fX24J3qkmFODyBbdDkgW3Q\"/><figcaption>胡子彤。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"關心妍。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827509471088640291640.jpeg/OIM0v04BDc41UvBX_x21d8_sGJR9NSNXnCBjXKogY1w\"/><figcaption>關心妍。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827506312646656842031.jpeg/1t_zV9BGgKHB7aQ-WKWfUDZtFsIw4AFhpSTOk5MkzpM\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JW與老公王至尊。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199827503376502784681503.jpeg/cwBSP2s9BOQJksdQGzurQtzjuBKReMEzHHIpMCpyKTA\"/><figcaption>JW與老公王至尊。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>約8時半，Janice就以《﻿﻿﻿Break-a-way﻿﻿﻿》、《My Cookie Can》及《﻿﻿一格格》打頭陣，以一第黑色低胸裙閃亮登場。</p><figure><img alt=\"Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199828229729554432617324.jpeg/8sbjxiUycbDW2KcPPYukbauAJqvRh1VaHz-zdik_s3Y\"/><figcaption>Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199828227107983360871604.jpeg/HMzLwRTM3vq9I-2bF0FgWE7IUa0DJ_3Eix-Y-b0fmPk\"/><figcaption>Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199828224259919872957026.jpeg/r8XC_LLQG1w_-UlX8ktH2sl9XjsP11K3aQE6U18BOlM\"/><figcaption>Janice演唱會今日尾場。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:08:57.030231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":431,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:55:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:26.142625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:18.588552+00:00","content_hash":"a1b33aee6595cc27897e61599693fa067420dca8251077fcc8f15d1f1fbad60d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}